      {
        "citations": null,
        "text": "\n\n---\n\n## \u2705 Method 2: Inline JavaScript with `onmouseover` / `onmouseout`\n\nYou can use inline event handlers directly on the `<span>` tag:\n\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <body>\n    <span\n      onmouseover=\"this.style.color='red';\"\n      onmouseout=\"this.style.color='black';\"\n    >\n      Hover over me!\n    </span>\n  </body>\n</html>\n```\n\n",
